   "ruling": "Ruling: scope; refusal located elsewhere. i8959 p. 4, Line 19, \"Also include any uncollected Medicare tax on tips from Form W-2, box 12, code B, and any uncollected Medicare tax on the taxable cost of group-term life insurance ... code N\". A W-2 with code B or N in box 12 is asked by s2.w2_marks (\"code A, B, K, M, N or Z in box 12?\", asked whenever a W-2 is listed, the only case line 19 has a value), which refuses Schedule 2 (lines 2 and 21 among others) through s2.other, and so the tax on Form 1040. No completed return has a code B or N amount; box 6 alone is right on every computed return. Project stands.",
